{"id":"motivo","lemma":"motivo","pos":"noun","rank":506,"glosses":["motive (that which incites to action)","motif (short melodic passage that is repeated in several parts of a work)"],"ipa":"/moˈt͡ʃi.vu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/96/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-motivo.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-motivo.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"motivos"},"examples":[{"text":"Você sabe o motivo?","en":"Do you know the reason?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41957","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Há um motivo para isso.","en":"There's a reason for that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1271045","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Qual poderia ser o motivo?","en":"What could be the reason?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270329","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Eu tive meus motivos.","en":"I had my reasons.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"my kin"},null]},{"text":"Estou feliz por três motivos.","en":"I'm glad for three reasons.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"happy"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"three"},null]}]}